ue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, tied with November to December. In 2025 on the middle, September to October came in at 21% of normal and October to November at 37%. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 30% and May to June at 206%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 13388 at 51% that year.</p>"}
